  "historyNote": "#2261, eff 1-17-83; ss by #3193, eff 1-28-86; ss by #5317, EMERGENCY, eff 1-29-92, EXPIRED: 5-28-92 New. #5513, eff 11-25-92; ss by #5665, eff 7-14-93; ss by #6895, INTERIM, eff 11-26-98, EXPIRED: 3-26-99 New. #8746, eff 10-25-06; ss by #10813, eff 4-21-15; ss by #13333, eff 1-25-22; ss by #14358, eff 8-28-25, EXPIRES: 8-28-35",
